  "title": "LG-PF and LGFN: Lightweight Polarization Fusion for Camouflaged Object Detection",
  "summary": "LG-PF and LGFN propose lightweight frameworks for polarization image fusion, enabling polarized object detection while balancing reliability and performance. LG-PF improves fusion accuracy and computational efficiency, while LGFN supports both RGB and polarization-assisted configurations.",
